d="M6.453 15h11.094"></path><path d="M8.5 2h7"></path></svg>Try this model</button></div></div><div data-slot="clamped-text" class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-1"><div id="_R_4ebsnqbt3dml9ivb_" data-slot="clamped-text-content" class="relative overflow-hidden max-h-(--disclosure-height) transition-[max-height] ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none duration-medium" data-allow-inline-style="true"><div class="text-prose leading-prose text-prose-body line-clamp-2"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0 leading-prose">Sonnet 5 is Anthropic&#x27;s most capable Sonnet-class model, with frontier performance across coding, agents, and professional work. It supports adaptive thinking with selectable reasoning effort levels (low, medium, high, max, and x-high), a 1M-token context window, and text, image, and file inputs. Sonnet 5 uses an updated tokenizer and includes real-time cyber safeguards that block certain high-risk dual-use activities.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2.5"><div class="flex min-h-5 items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-2xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">Modalities</div></div><div class="mt-1 text-base font-medium leading-tight tabular-nums"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md size-5 bg-modality-text/12" id="base-ui-_R_3aomebsnqbt3dml9ivb_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-type size-3 text-modality-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16"></path><path d="M4 7V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2"></path><path d="M9 20h6"></path