dth="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark size-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>FAQ</a><a href="#explore" class="relative flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-body font-medium cursor-pointer transition-colors no-underline text-muted-foreground hover:text-accent-foreground hover:bg-card-hover"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg>Explore</a></div></div></nav></aside><div class="min-w-0"><div class="lg:hidden -mx-4 px-4 sticky z-30 bg-background border-b border-border/50 py-2 mb-6 top-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+44px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))]"><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" id="base-ui-_R_1qpbqubsnqbt3dml9ivb_" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 w-full min-h-11 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-md bg-muted text-overline cursor-pointer outline-none"><span class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-server w-4 h-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg><span class="font-medium text-foreground truncate">Providers</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-faint shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div><section id="providers" class="scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-1.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-server h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg><h2 class="text-base font-medium">Providers</h2></div></div><p class="mb-4 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Different companies host the same model. OpenRouter routes your request to one of them based on the routing mode you pick — Balanced (price + speed), Nitro (fastest), Floor (cheapest), or Exacto (highest tool-calling accuracy).</p><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 sm:p-5"><!--$?--><template id="B:5"></template><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-stretch gap-2 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-9 w-32"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-9 w-36"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-9 w-36"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-9 w-36"></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border"><div class="grid border-border border-b gap-4 p-4 grid-cols-4"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-full"></div></div><div class="grid border-border border-b gap-4 p-4 grid-cols-4 last:border-b-0"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div></div><div class="grid border-border border-b gap-4 p-4 grid-cols-4 last:border-b-0"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div></div><div class="grid border-border border-b gap-4 p-4 grid-cols-4 last:border-b-0"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div></div><div class="grid border-border border-b gap-4 p-4 grid-cols-4 last:border-b-0"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div></div><div class="grid border-border border-b gap-4 p-4 grid-cols-4 last:border-b-0"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-5 w-full"></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></section><section id="pricing" class="scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-1.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg><h2 class="text-base font-medium">Pricing</h2></div></div><p class="mb-4 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The average price customers actually pay for this model, next to the prices providers post. Caching and discounts mean the price actually paid is often well below the listed one.</p><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 sm:p-5"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></section><section id="performance" class="scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-1.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg><h2 class="text-base font-medium">Performance</h2></div></div><p class="mb-4 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Throughput is how fast the model writes (tokens per second — higher is better). Latency is total round-trip time (lower is better). TTFT is time-to-first-token — how long before you see anything appear (lower is better).</p><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 sm:p-5"><!--$?--><template id="B:6"></template><!--/$--></div></section><section id="uptime" class="scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-1.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg><h2 class="text-base font-medium">Uptime</h2></div></div><p class="mb-4 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Uptime is the percentage of the past 3 days that at least one provider was responding to requests. Availability is the percentage of time that inference was successfully served. OpenRouter continuously monitors and uses the next-best provider when one returns an error.</p><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 sm:p-5"><!--$?--><template id="B:7"></template><!--/$--></div></section><section id="benchmarks" class="scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-1.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2">