uited for long-running, complex, and asynchronous tasks that previously required frequent human check-ins.\\n\\nIt is particularly strong at end-to-end work that would otherwise take a person hours, days, or weeks - taking on problems that are long-running, ambiguous, or highly multi-step. It executes well-scoped tasks with few mistakes, automatically self-correcting through verification loops, and ships with robust safeguards.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-09T12:18:35.266Z\",\"context_length\":1000000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"anthropic/claude-fable-5\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"anthropic/claude-5-fable-20260609\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"0.0000125\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write (1h)\",\"price\":\"0.00002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.01\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00001\",\"completion\":\"0.00005\",\"web_search\":\"0.01\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.000001\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.0000125\",\"input_cache_write_1h\":\"0.00002\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"anthropic/claude-fable-5\",\"permaslug\":\"anthropic/claude-5-fable-20260609\",\"name\":\"Anthropic: Claude Fable 5 (batch)\",\"description\":\"Claude Fable 5 is a Mythos-class model from Anthropic, built for autonomous knowledge work and coding. It supports text, image, and file inputs with text output, with reasoning support and a 1M-token context window. It is suited for long-running, complex, and asynchronous tasks that previously required frequent human check-ins.\\n\\nIt is particularly strong at end-to-end work that would otherwise take a person hours, days, or weeks - taking on problems that are long-running, ambiguous, or highly multi-step. It executes well-scoped tasks with few mistakes, automatically self-correcting through verification loops, and ships with robust safeguards.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-09T12:18:35.266Z\",\"context_length\":1000000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"anthropic/claude-fable-5:batch\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"anthropic/claude-5-fable-20260609:batch\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.000005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.000025\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"5e-7\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"0.00000625\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write (1h)\",\"price\":\"0.000010\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.01\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.000005\",\"completion\":\"0.000025\",\"web_search\":\"0.01\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000005\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.00000625\",\"input_cache_write_1h\":\"0.00001\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"anthropic/claude-opus-4.8-fast\",\"permaslug\":\"anthropic/claude-4.8-opus-fast-20260528\",\"name\":\"Anthropic: Claude Opus 4.8 (Fast)\",\"description\":\"Fast-mode variant of [Opus 4.8](/anthropic/claude-opus-4.8) - identical capabilities with higher output speed at 2x pricing relative to regular Opus 4.8.\\n\\nLearn more in Anthropic's docs: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/fast-mode\\n\\nNote: As of September 1, 2026, this dedicated fast model is deprecated. Fast mode is now served by the `fast` service tier endpoint on [Claude Opus 4.8](https://openrouter.ai/anthropic/claude-opus-4.8) — request it with `service_tier: \\\"fast\\\"` or `speed: \\\"fast\\\"`. Requests to this model keep working and are served by the same fast tier capacity, so no action is required, but new integrations should target the regular model. Learn more in our service tier docs: https://openrouter.ai/docs/guides/features/service-tiers\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-27T20:28:23.711Z\",\"context_length\":1000000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"anthropic/claude-opus-4.8\",\"permaslug\":\"anthropic/claude-4.8-opus-20260528\",\"name\":\"Anthropic: Claude Opus 4.8\",\"description\":\"Claude Opus 4.8 is Anthropic's most capable generally available model in the Opus family. It supports text, image, and file inputs with text output, with reasoning support and a 1M-token context window. It is suited for highly autonomous agents, long-horizon agentic work, knowledge work, and memory-driven tasks where coherence over extended sessions matters.\\n\\nIt is particularly strong on multi-step reasoning, complex coding, and end-to-end project orchestration - large codebases, multi-stage debugging, and long-running asynchronous agent pipelines. Beyond coding, it handles knowledge work such as drafting documents, building presentations, and analyzing data, maintaining quality across very long outputs.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-27T18:04:51.937Z\",\"context_length\":1000000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"anthropic/claude-opus-4.8\",\"model_variant_pe